research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/ex-alternating-harmonic-series.md-1626-- **The witness is not exotic.** It is the first series a reader meets whose convergence depends on cancellation, and the failure is as large as it can be: the series of absolute values does not merely converge to a different number, it diverges to $+\infty$.
